# Core Module

Session conversion & parsing logic.

## Components

### `UniversalSession`
Common denominator for all formats. All converters use this.

### `SessionConverter`
Converts UniversalSession → any format & back.
- `to_pyrogram()` / `from_pyrogram()`
- `to_telethon()` / `from_telethon()`
- `to_gramjs()` / `from_gramjs()`
- `to_mtcute()`
- `to_json()` / `from_dict()`
- `to_auth_key_string()` / `from_auth_key_string()`
- `convert_all()` — all formats at once

### `SessionParser`
Auto-detect any session string format.

## Example
```python
from core import SessionConverter, SessionParser, UniversalSession

# Parse any format
session = SessionParser.parse(some_string, api_id=123, api_hash="abc")

# Convert to all
all_formats = SessionConverter.convert_all(session)
print(all_formats["pyrogram"])
